    {
      "cn_text": "虽然人工智能提供了令人兴奋的可能性，但它也引发了伦理担忧。它可能加剧社会对美的压力，并延续难以企及的美的标准。",
      "en_text": "While AI offers exciting possibilities, it also raises ethical concerns.There is a risk of deepening societal beauty pressures and perpetuating unattainable beauty standards.",
