    {
      "cn_text": "需要注意的是，虽然人工智能可以增进我们对美的欣赏，但它不应取代我们从彼此身上发现美所获得的真实人类体验和情感联系。",
      "en_text": "It’s important to note that while AI can enhance our appreciation of beauty, it should not replace the genuine human experience and the emotional connections we derive from seeing the beauty in each other.",
